Third-party provenance for visloc-basalt
========================================

This directory is classified as a clean-room Rust translation and contains
diagnostic programs.  The audit found no vendored or copied source subtree
from the projects below.  The entries
are retained because the implementation and oracle build are intentionally
compatible with the listed upstream APIs, algorithms, and numerical behavior.
Keep this notice with any source or binary redistribution of this directory.

