Audit record
------------
The exact current source paths, immutable commits, SPDX identifiers,
translation status, and SHA-256 hashes are in
benchmarks/basalt/basalt_provenance_manifest_v2.json.  The immutable v1
manifest remains historical evidence.  This notice is a technical attribution
record, not legal advice or a line-by-line authorship determination.  The current
Cargo dependency/license inventory is
benchmarks/basalt/cargo_license_inventory_v2.json: all 119 of 119 lockfile rows
are resolved and `unresolved=0`, with crate, checksum, SPDX, license-file, and
source evidence.  Its ort/ort-sys records retain an explicit dirty VCS
provenance caveat, and winapi 0.4.0 uses upstream license evidence because the
license texts are not packaged in the crate; a release owner should obtain
legal review and audit transitive vcpkg packages before any source or binary
bundling.
